From: Jagpal Singh Gill <paligill@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 13 Jul 2026 14:10:18 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] rtu: control port monitoring over D-Bus

Implement the xyz.openbmc_project.Control.Port interface on each serial
port object at /xyz/openbmc_project/control/port/<PortName>. Writing the
MonitoringEnabled property false reserves the port so no other traffic
occurs on it; writing it true resumes monitoring.

BasePort inherits the interface and handles the property write by
holding an ExclusiveLock while monitoring is disabled. The property
reflects the actual state, so a failed reservation leaves it unchanged.
An object manager for the port-control namespace is added so the objects
are discoverable.

Tested: Unit tests pass

Signed-off-by: Jagpal Singh Gill <paligill@gmail.com>
Change-Id: Ic79128be4c2dff1e63281ad1e2bdf4c4f45f3cc0
